.TH SIGMA-NET 1 "2026-06-27" "SigmaOS" "SigmaOS User Commands"

.SH NAME
sigma-net \- SigmaOS network configuration and diagnostics

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sigma-net
.IR command
.RI [ options ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sigma-net
manages and diagnoses the SigmaOS network stack. It wraps the
.BR sigma-netd (8)
daemon and the sigma_net unified interface, providing TLS 1.3,
DNS-over-HTTPS, DHCP, WPA3/SAE, firewall, and mesh VPN management.

.SH COMMANDS

.SS status
Show current network state: interfaces, IP addresses, DHCP lease, DNS.
.nf
$ sigma-net status
eth0: 192.168.1.10/24 (DHCP bound, 3h 42m remaining)
  DNS: 1.1.1.1 (DoH), DNSSEC: enabled
  TX: 1.2 GB   RX: 3.4 GB
wlan0: not connected
mesh0: 10.152.0.1/24 (sigma-mesh active, 3 peers)
.fi

.SS connect
Connect to a WiFi network.
.nf
$ sigma-net connect "My-Network" --wpa3    # WPA3-Personal
$ sigma-net connect "Corp-WiFi" --wpa3-ent --cert /path/to/cert.pem
$ sigma-net connect "Open-Network" --owe   # WPA3 OWE (encrypted open)
.fi

.SS disconnect
Disconnect from a network interface.
.nf
$ sigma-net disconnect wlan0
.fi

.SS dns
Manage DNS resolver settings.
.nf
$ sigma-net dns status             # show resolver config
$ sigma-net dns set --doh https://dns.quad9.net/dns-query
$ sigma-net dns set --dot 9.9.9.9  # DNS-over-TLS
$ sigma-net dns test sigma-os.dev  # resolve + show DNSSEC status
$ sigma-net dns flush-cache        # clear the resolver cache
.fi

.SS dhcp
Manage DHCP leases.
.nf
$ sigma-net dhcp status eth0       # show current lease
$ sigma-net dhcp renew eth0        # force renewal
$ sigma-net dhcp release eth0      # release lease
.fi

.SS firewall
Manage the sigma-shield packet filter.
.nf
$ sigma-net firewall status        # active rules + conntrack count
$ sigma-net firewall allow tcp 443 # allow HTTPS outbound
$ sigma-net firewall block tcp 25  # block SMTP
$ sigma-net firewall flush         # clear all user rules
$ sigma-net firewall list          # list all rules
.fi

.SS mesh
Manage the sigma-mesh WireGuard VPN.
.nf
$ sigma-net mesh init              # generate keypair, create mesh0
$ sigma-net mesh pubkey            # show local public key
$ sigma-net mesh peer add <pubkey> <endpoint>
$ sigma-net mesh peer list         # list peers + latency
$ sigma-net mesh status            # mesh interface stats
.fi

.SS ping
Test connectivity.
.nf
$ sigma-net ping 8.8.8.8
$ sigma-net ping sigma-os.dev --count 5
.fi

.SS trace
Trace route to a destination.
.nf
$ sigma-net trace sigma-os.dev
.fi

.SH SECURITY FEATURES

.TP
All DNS queries use DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) by default with DNSSEC validation.

.TP
WiFi uses WPA3-Personal (SAE) by default when the AP supports it; falls back to WPA2 with a warning.

.TP
The sigma-mesh VPN uses WireGuard (ChaCha20-Poly1305) for all inter-node communication.

.TP
All TLS connections use TLS 1.3 with X25519+Kyber-1024 hybrid key exchange.

.SH FILES
.TP
.I /run/sigma/netd.sock
sigma-netd Unix socket.

.TP
.I /sigma/etc/network/
Network configuration files.

